{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3aa71be8d58407ac1ac61f67aec02f087a26710d54aee444a4d7b4110f573bd", "ja": "（生き残りゲーム映画の撮影日当日……星梨花は\nゲームの主催者役を演じることになっているが……）", "zh": "（生存游戏电影的拍摄日当天……星梨花将饰演游戏的主办者，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9cc9e63ca1a62a4536f660d6ba2add26562ba99fadde82e2326c7a541f1fd75d", "ja": "星梨花、大丈夫そうか？　稽古の時から、だいぶ\nプレッシャーがかかっていたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "星梨花，你看起来还好吗？从排练的时候开始，好像就一直承受着很大的压力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "2bd8f8db969ae07cbe68ce741140c4ff90e912f66e0c271c582c1ab634214a64", "ja": "最初は不安でしたけど……わたし、決めたんです。\n自信を持って、堂々とお芝居するって！", "zh": "一开始确实很不安……但我已经下定决心了。\n要充满自信、堂堂正正地去演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1bbe0a644e7c30238a17808cd36c8e369c17837f822b8078909d8edc369db61", "ja": "それに、パパとお話したことでちょっとだけ自信も\nついたんですよ。だから、今日もがんばります！", "zh": "而且，和爸爸聊过之后，我也稍微有了点自信。所以，今天也要加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6f2cada87543ec29916622b3afc4bc535e95a9657dedfe6bd850668444353a5d", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな。\nけど、お父さんと話したっていうのは？", "zh": "哦，真让人放心啊。  \n不过，你说和父亲谈过，是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "2f6946b4d38a8295f8556638f11743910bad8941b076c06bf21d2d3ac0ae525b", "ja": "{$P$}さんに言ってませんでしたけど\n……この作品に出演するのを、パパに反対されてて。", "zh": "虽然之前没跟{$P$}先生说过\n……但出演这部作品，其实被爸爸反对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "50ef72874ea6e28cc4ffb161d03699d7b473cd9777be0dbb1001d57d15c5a2ea", "ja": "「子ども扱いしないで！」って言っても、\n「こんな物騒な作品、星梨花にはまだ早い」って……。", "zh": "就算我说了“别把我当小孩子！”，\n爸爸也还是说“这种危险题材的作品，对星梨花来说还太早了”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3992caa5478f2206b9b08ed2c524ab4c9d1930c178b4e1289f357d2bc69988e8", "ja": "そうだったのか……すまない、\nそういう事なら俺も、説明に向かうべきだったな。", "zh": "原来是这样……抱歉，既然是这么回事，我也应该去说明一下才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "472320a76d947dff5ba49b9c8a4cd80022346215275c927370dad7624225d6c7", "ja": "いえ！　わたしが、パパのことを\nひとりで説得したくて、わざと黙ってたんです。", "zh": "不是的！我只是想一个人说服爸爸，所以才故意没有告诉您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6c5e0a9558e4367b126386bc217d62f7e767aca02d393b19195f980e1a38bbd", "ja": "ひとりで……？", "zh": "一个人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc76388026da541e8eb46c50bca7484a15f357f0ac3df8608564b77f3933fb8e", "ja": "はい。今回の役、とっても悩みましたけど……\nでも、だからこそ、ちゃんと演じたかったんです。", "zh": "是的。这次的角色让我烦恼了很久……\n但正因为如此，我才更想好好演绎这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "8cc5a45b891e7b1475335378186e73a4c6838f25d7ec276a4a84481eaaa47e94", "ja": "だから絶対に、パパを説得したいって思ったんです。", "zh": "所以我才绝对想说服爸爸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3861c8b1fc81058a97c13b0211243c06e3d6cde41e0e91105b347821533bee27", "ja": "そうか。お父さんは、納得してくれたのか？", "zh": "这样啊。那你父亲同意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "df11d8ae39a2ca26f70d1333fc6ac2c37eb20550cbc89376af8eab1105d85b9e", "ja": "はい。説得するのは大変でしたけど、わたしの気持ちを\n伝えたら、最後には許してもらえたんですよ！", "zh": "是的。虽然说服爸爸很不容易，但把我的心情告诉他之后，最后他还是同意了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e74ace16c78bb8833a3894f1bcbe2bd3a68b3edd16f9c0b62c62ab46d1bf6cc8", "ja": "正直、まだ不安はあります。でも、パパと真剣に\n話した時みたいに、一生懸命お芝居ができたら……。", "zh": "说实话，我还是有些不安。不过，要是能像认真和爸爸交谈时那样，全心全意地演好这出戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1015_p", "source_sha256": "74ef648527123028c46592d6546e4ceb9f344b013ca39b43239b20aa6abb26f7", "ja": "そのやり取りが少しでも自信に繋がったなら、\n結果オーライなのかな。本番も、その調子で頼むぞ！", "zh": "如果那番交流能让你稍微增添一些自信，也算是皆大欢喜了吧。正式演出时也要保持这个状态，加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2fe85acc57e8d96981e762462f90f6b1fe292d18bf85c23406e3f9b0c7ee489", "ja": "はいっ。演技で見せるわたしの『新たな一面』……\nファンのみなさんが喜んでくれるといいな……♪", "zh": "好！通过演技展现给大家的我『全新的一面』……要是粉丝们能喜欢就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0443_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cd347da35ae4500f542fcc1b543ec72691ca22fddfd7120d5e928c690c4413b5", "ja": "（頼もしい限りだな。後は……星梨花のお父さんに、\nフォローの連絡を入れておくとするか）", "zh": "（真是让人放心啊。接下来……我去联系一下星梨花的爸爸，跟他说明一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
